# slots_methods.pdl - generated by `eden_op <conductor> gen-slots methods`: 2 x max_slots METHOD rows for an entity menu that can hold them (paste into meta.pdl). $0 = the conductor dir.
METHOD       | Save 1 | sh -c 'exec "$0/ops/+x/eden_op.+x" "$0" save 1'
METHOD       | Save 2 | sh -c 'exec "$0/ops/+x/eden_op.+x" "$0" save 2'
METHOD       | Save 3 | sh -c 'exec "$0/ops/+x/eden_op.+x" "$0" save 3'
